# Western visual prompt contract

Use this block in every character, keyframe, and Seedance 2.5 prompt. Replace bracketed values; do not delete the camera, palette, lighting, or exclusion line.

```text
Live-action Western/European short drama, [genre and emotional beat], [subject and precise action], [approved location], Sony VENICE 2, [lens/focal length], very shallow depth of field, cinematic natural skin texture, low-saturation neutral palette, [motivated light]; warm interior top light when indoors, grounded production design, physically plausible wardrobe and props, vertical 9:16 composition, foreground/midground/background separation, restrained realistic performance, no on-screen text, no watermark.

Negative / exclusion: 国漫, 二次元, CG卡通, 动漫线条, 玄幻特效, illustration, cel shading, plastic skin, glamour beauty filter, Chinese costume drama, ARRI Alexa Mini LF visual preset.
```

## Seedance 2.5 shot suffix

```text
Duration [2-5] seconds. Camera: [locked-off / slow push-in / handheld follow / lateral track]. Action: [one readable action]. Performance: [micro-expression or physical behavior]. Audio: [diegetic sound + optional music cue]. Continuity: [costume, prop, screen direction]. Keep live-action physics and temporal continuity; no new character, prop, location, or plot event.
```

## Location anchors

- Executive office: smoked glass, walnut, restrained skyline reflections, practical desk lamps.
- Fine dining: linen, glassware, candle warmth, controlled background bokeh.
- European courtroom: pale stone, dark wood, daylight spill, institutional restraint.
- Rainy underground garage: wet concrete, sodium-vapor pools, distant tire hiss.
- Western town: weathered timber, dust, hard sun, subdued earth tones; live-action historical realism.
- Apocalypse shelter: patched concrete, battery lanterns, ration labels, practical grime, no fantasy glow.
